/erl-entrance env_0080_big_box_general_merchandise_retailer N=5 M=2 — Customer care of a national general merchandise big-box retailer (B2C, B2B): customers hold loyalty memberships with delivery benefits, store credit cards and protection plans, booking store and online orders, pickup and delivery, returns and price adjustments, membership fees, card payments and disputes, marketplace-seller items and protection claims. Prioritize the realism of the scenario when generating the environment, tasks, and documents: everything, especially the associated settings of prerequisite tasks, must conform to real-world scenarios and existing logic rather than being fabricated. Output folder: env/env_0080_big_box_general_merchandise_retailer. This is an unattended run: never ask questions or wait for confirmation.
